Z||000000||sdm1964||03-04-2001||09:35 AM||||I was working on the electronics of an M1 tank, I stuck my head up out of the hatch to get another tool and just caught the last 10 seconds of a pace car go by. About an hour later it passed by going the other way. There was a female driving it. There was no way i could signal her so i could introduce her to the forum or give her a card. It seemed to be in super condition. I have never seen it at Ft. Stewart before and with so few days left before i depart the task of finding the owner might be impossible. Looks like it might be up to 2xses to complete the task. Just thought i would share.||||reg||6
